        "body": "Monthly release of the GTN materials is now [available on the archive](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/).\n\n#### 📰 News\n\n-   [Galaxy Training Academy 2026: A Global Week of Learning (October 16, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/news/2026/10/16/gta2026-recap.html?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n\n#### 📅 Events\n\n-   [Workshop on high-throughput sequencing data analysis with Galaxy (October 05, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/events/2027-03-01-hts-workshop-freiburg.html?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n\n#### 📚 Tutorials\n\n-   [Use Pycytominer in Galaxy for processing high dimensional image-based readouts (October 08, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/topics/imaging/tutorials/pycytominer/tutorial.html?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n-   [Introduction to Metabarcoding using QIIME 2 (October 07, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/topics/microbiome/tutorials/dunnart_metabarcoding/tutorial.html?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n-   [Understanding Galaxy Data Managers (October 06, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/topics/dev/tutorials/data-manager-architecture/tutorial.html?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n\n#### 🛠️ Workflows\n\n-   [pycitominer-training (October 08, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/topics/imaging/tutorials/pycytominer/workflows/pycitominer-testing.html?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n-   [Metabarcoding Dunnart QIIME2 Analysis (October 07, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/topics/microbiome/tutorials/dunnart_metabarcoding/workflows/Metabarcoding-Dunnart-QIIME2-Analysis.html?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n\n#### 🧑‍🏫 Contributors\n\n-   [\\@vebaev (October 01, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/hall-of-fame/vebaev/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n-   [\\@detocjerome (October 01, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/hall-of-fame/detocjerome/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n-   [\\@d33bs (October 01, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/hall-of-fame/d33bs/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n-   [\\@axiomcura (October 01, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/hall-of-fame/axiomcura/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n\n#### 💰 Grants\n\n-   [\\@esg4stars (October 01, 2026)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/archive/2026-11-02/hall-of-fame/esg4stars/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=release&utm_campaign=release-notes)\n\n[Powered by [GTN RSS Feeds](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/news/2024/06/04/gtn-standards-rss.html)]{.small}\n",
